---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for DnR Dispatch Research.">
  <div class="shell">
    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="page-header__eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    </header>
    <div class="static-prose">
      <p>
        DnR Dispatch Research collects as little data as the site can run on. This page explains
        what's collected and why.
      </p>

      <h2>Email subscriptions</h2>
      <p>
        If you subscribe to The Brief, the email address you provide is sent directly to
        Buttondown, our newsletter provider, and used only to deliver dispatches you've signed up
        for. We don't sell or share your email address with anyone else. You can unsubscribe from
        any email at any time using the link in the footer of that email.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        The site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics, which does not use cookies or collect personal
        data, and doesn't track you across other sites. It gives us aggregate numbers — which
        pages get read, roughly how much traffic returns — with nothing tied back to an individual
        visitor.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This site does not set advertising or tracking cookies. Any cookies used are strictly
        functional (for example, remembering a form was already submitted).
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        If how we handle data changes, this page will be updated with a new effective date.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
